{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":194,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"6b6523eb-b1d8-4ec7-ba54-e740cd37bb25","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190871641,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"电气工程师","OrgId":3206695,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、负责制订产品相关的设计控制系统架构；\n2、负责电气部件的设计、可靠性分析、结构优化及改进方案的实现；\n3、负责所设计机台电气部件零部件的选型、采购、质量评估，与加工供应商的技术沟通；\n4、协助制造人员完成研发产品首台的装调；\n5、运行中故障的排查和问题解决；\n6、负责所设计电气部件的设计及装调文档编写及管理；\n7、负责制订所负责设计项目计划，并按计划推进；\n8、负责项目管理，指导项目中的设计实现，及客户端问题解决。","Require":"1、电气、电子、自动化、测控等相关专业，本科学历3年以上工作经验，硕士学历3年以上工作经验；\n2、熟练使用Solidworks Electrical/Altium designer等设计软件。具备电气、自动控制相关知识，熟悉电气行业标准及设计规范，主导过大型自动化项目或非标设备设计，熟练掌握PLC系统设计、编程、调试能力及现场总线技术。\n3、CET-4及以上，英语听说能力良好。\n4、具备较强的责任心与抗压能力，有良好的团队协作能力和沟通能力；","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-19T17:05:27","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"ea24353c-f66b-4f81-949e-0bea363c80da","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190870753,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"厂务技术员（弱电）","OrgId":3207211,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、熟悉厂务系统的工作流程，能够对厂务系统涉及自控维护与保养，包含：电力、制冷系统、空调系统、水源热泵系统、CDA、PV酸排普排、PCW等相关系统的操作。\n2、能快速识别厂务系统安全隐患，并制定预防及安全整改措施。\n3、负责系统及设备故障的排除处理，制定并执行设备的检修计划，提升设备的使用效率。\n5、配合其他部门完成相关的技术支持和现场服务工作。\n6、执行厂务设备、设施的日常点巡检工作。\n7、负责新厂建设自控系统规划与信息整合，负责老厂自动化系统升级改造，能够独立处理设备自控故障，协助各系统利用程序监测排查问题。\n8、建立并完善厂务系统流程制度，不断优化现场操作OI文件。","Require":"1、全日制本科学历及5年以上相关工作经验，自控、弱电、机电等相关专业。\n2、至少2年以上半导体行业或相关洁净厂房运维工作经验。\n3、具有较强的责任心、良好的沟通能力、表达能力，较强的合作意识和团队精神。\n4、具备较强的动手能力，能熟练使用CAD及office等相关软件。\n5、具备高、低压电工证。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-15T09:16:46","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"4e6f177f-00a3-48ab-ab1b-4d92579111f4","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190870035,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"机械工程师","OrgId":3207151,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、负责平台机械CIP需求、新平台设计，相关仿真分析；\n2、负责平台改造、新平台相关文档编写，测试验证；\n3、负责客户端相关问题支持排查以及具体解决方案；","Require":"1、机械设计制造及其自动化，动力工程及工程热物理、精密仪器及测量，化工过程控制，真空工程，能源动力工程， 金属材料等专业， 研究生3以上相关工作经验；\n2、熟练掌握绘图Soliwork, AutoCAD等软件，掌握产品开发流程、机械设计、工程制图、公差分析、工程材料性能和材料力学分析等技能；\n3、了解流体/空气动力学、真空工程设计、化工原理、传热学等相关知识；\n4. 对产品开发流程、机械设计、工程制图和公差分析、工程材料性能和材料力学有所了解；\n5、从事过半导体真空设备、喷淋头、陶瓷盘、热管理、自动化装备设计、精密仪器设计或过程装备设计者优先；\n6、有良好的沟通能力，较强的抗压能力，跨部门沟通能力，复杂问题解决能力，多事项并发处理能力等。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-13T11:03:27","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"62db468b-452b-4473-978e-ee5bcf9f8e16","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190869814,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"质量检验技术员（IQC）","OrgId":3207181,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、依据机械图纸和公差要求，使用测量仪器和专用检具，对精密结构件、钣金件等关键尺寸、形位公差、表面质量、密封性等进行检测，确保来料满足要求；对电气与电子组件执行型号核对、基础功能通电测试，验证其电气参数与信号输出符合设计要求。\n2、发现尺寸超差或性能不符时，进行不合格品处置并跟进不合格报告，协助评估返工、挑选或退货等方案，汇总来料质量趋势，并做台账管理供后续追溯；针对重复性异常问题发出整改要求。\n3、核对来料随附的材质证明、表面处理报告，并对其进行管理查询。\n4、参与新零件首件认证，跟踪关键特性测试结果和意见。\n5、辅助定期校准检验设备，以保证检测结果准确。","Require":"1. 全日制大专及以上学历，机械、机电、材料、测控等相关专业；2年以上精密结构件、钣金件或电气电子组件来料检验/质量检验经验，能看懂机械图纸，熟悉尺寸公差、形位公差、表面质量及密封性检测要求或类似工作经历\n2. 熟练使用卡尺、千分尺、高度规、投影仪、三坐标等常用测量仪器及专用检具，具备三坐标编程能力者优先\n3.  熟悉不合格品处置、来料质量趋势分析、台账追溯及整改跟进流程，能核对材质证明、表面处理报告；责任心强，原则性强，具备良好的沟通协调、报告编写及跨部门协作能力。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-12T17:12:29","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"6a16a853-8ed0-4a64-9d58-337f69122290","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190869809,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"过程质量主管工程师（PQE）","OrgId":3207181,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1、负责半导体设备制造过程中的质量监控与管理，提升机台出厂合格水平；\n2、主导分析并解决生产过程中出现的质量问题，包括判责和闭环管理，提高制造问题关闭率；\n3、主导制定制造质量改进计划，推动实施，提高生产效率和产品质量；\n4、组织当日制造现场问题响应和解决会议，推动交付；\n5、主导制造客诉质量问题汇报，促进客户满意。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，专业不限，有电子工程、材料科学等相关专业背景者优先；\n2、熟悉质量管理流程和方法，具有丰富的质量管理实践经验；\n3、具备较强的问题分析和解决能力，能够独立判断和处理复杂的技术问题；\n4、良好的沟通协调能力和团队合作精神，能够有效推动跨部门协作解决问题；\n5、具备5-10年的半导体设备制造行业相关工作经验优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-12T17:08:10","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"466c571a-b27d-48ef-9c8a-0bc9e292e13c","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190867592,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"质量管理总监","OrgId":3207180,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1. 全面负责供应商质量管理体系的建设与运行，制定并优化SQE工作流程、审核标准及绩效评价机制；  \n2. 主导关键物料/零部件供应商的准入评估、现场审核（含体系审核与过程审核）、年度复评及分级管理，推动供应商质量能力持续提升；  \n3. 牵头处理来料不合格（IQC异常）、生产过程批量性质量问题及客户投诉中的供应商责任问题，组织8D报告评审与闭环验证；  \n4. 深度参与新供应商开发与新项目导入（NPI），协同采购、研发开展供应商早期介入（ESI）、PPAP批准及首批量产质量保障；  \n5. 建立并维护核心供应商质量数据库，运用SPC、CPK、GRR等工具监控关键特性过程能力，识别潜在风险并推动预防措施落地；  \n6. 指导并赋能供应商开展质量改进活动，组织质量技术培训与联合改善项目，培育高绩效、高协同的战略供应关系。","Require":"1. 本科及以上学历，机械工程、电子工程、材料科学、自动化、工业工程或质量管理等相关专业；  \n2. 具备10年以上制造业供应商质量管理经验，其中至少5年在汽车零部件、消费电子、医疗器械或高端装备等行业担任SQE主管、供应商质量经理或同等岗位；  \n3. 精通IATF 16949或ISO 13485标准中供应商管理相关条款，熟练掌握VDA 6.3过程审核、ISO 9001体系审核及供应商分层审核方法；  \n4. 熟练运用APQP、PPAP、FMEA、控制计划、MSA、SPC、8D等核心质量工具，具备独立主导复杂供应商质量问题分析与改进的能力；  \n5. 具备出色的沟通协调与谈判能力，能有效推动供应商落实整改、承担质量责任，并建立长期互信的合作关系；  \n6. 熟悉主流ERP/MES/QMS系统操作，具备基础数据分析能力（如Excel高级函数、Minitab基础应用），可独立完成供应商质量绩效报告编制与趋势分析。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-08T17:47:54","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"399baf6e-c3b2-4df7-9f70-876fcea708d5","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190867577,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"27届-机械实习生（沈阳）","OrgId":3206695,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"3","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.协助研发工程师完成半导体设备相关机械结构设计工作，熟练使用 SolidWorks、AutoCAD 进行三维建模、二维工程图绘制及图纸修改，确保图纸规范、准确。\n2.协助完成设计图纸整理、归档、版本管理及标准化工作，按要求搭建、维护产品 BOM 清单，保证物料信息完整准确，支撑研发与生产顺利衔接。\n3.协助工程师完成研发物料相关流程工作，包括物料申领、采购申请、物料转库、出入库跟进等，保障项目物料及时到位。\n4.负责 OEM 外协件资料收集、整理与归档，跟进样品交付、检验及问题反馈，协助完善供应商及物料基础信息库。\n5.配合工程师开展核心零部件性能测试、装配验证及样机调试工作，记录测试数据，整理测试报告，协助解决装配与测试过程中的技术问题。\n6.协助完成项目资料整理、技术文档编写与归档，参与研发会议纪要、样品跟踪、设计变更执行等日常研发辅助工作。\n7.服从部门工作安排，配合跨部门协作，高效完成工程师交办的其他研发支持任务。","Require":"1.2027届及之后毕业的，大专及以上学历。\n2.机械设计、机电一体化、真空技术、精密仪器等相关专业，具备半导体设备或精密机械相关学习或实习经验优先。\n3.熟练使用 SolidWorks、AutoCAD 等设计软件，具备基本的识图、绘图能力，了解机械加工工艺与公差配合优先。\n4.工作认真细致、责任心强，执行力好，具备良好的沟通协调能力与团队协作意识，能适应研发项目节奏。\n5.对半导体设备行业有基本认知，愿意在研发领域长期学习与发展，动手能力强，能吃苦耐劳。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-08T17:37:04","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"b8d0b811-5d1c-472d-9da1-e06069ae0b5f","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":190865862,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"采购寻源和供应商管理专家 （机械和机电一体化）","OrgId":3207288,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.负责机械和机电一体化品类的供应商资源整合和梳理，分析现有品类的供应商布局结构合理性，根据市场变化和业务配套对供应链品类的动态要求制定短期和长期的供应商开发、管理计划、制定不良供应商的业务终止和替换计划。\n2.负责机械和机电一